{
  "$schema": "./_schema.json",
  "$comment": [
    "In-process voice-cloning TTS (P6-I): Kyutai Pocket TTS through sherpa-onnx (local_tts::pocket, CPU) and Chatterbox Multilingual V3 as KitsuMate's split-speed ONNX export on Sigil's ONNX Runtime (local_tts::chatterbox_ort).",
    "Pocket: the sherpa-onnx 1.13.8 packages of the 2026-01-26 English model, sha256 from the GitHub release asset digests (release-tts-models).",
    "Chatterbox: KitsuMate/chatterbox-multilingual-v3-onnx at commit 3f44461db006cc1ffb553cda02d6f6841125288a (exported from ResembleAI/chatterbox 5bb1f6ee, t3_mtl23ls_v3 + s3gen), sha256 from the repository's manifest.json (checked against the downloaded small graphs). The split-speed CPU layout; the fp16 flow step is a separate optional entry for graphics cards. chinese_words.txt is not installed: Sigil segments Chinese with jieba-rs's dictionary (the same jieba dictionary the file was extracted from)."
  ],
